Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.00,0:00:04.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Listen, here's something you'll want to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.71,0:00:07.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It exists. A way back to Japan.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.50,0:00:15.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Long ago, we Four Major Human Errors\Ntried to destroy the world,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.38,0:00:17.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but only for one reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.29,0:00:20.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Because we wanted to return to our home world.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.83,0:00:24.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There really is a way to get back, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.96,0:00:27.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I don't care about that!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.67,0:00:29.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Here in this world, I have Menou!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.83,0:00:33.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I don't want to go home at all! Ever!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.29,0:00:36.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Maa, maa. How lovely.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.54,0:00:39.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I almost wish I could watch that\Nfriendship on the big screen.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.46,0:00:43.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I think that line does a good enough\Njob as trailer material.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.17,0:00:53.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Bye now!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.17,0:00:57.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I prefer to go home without watching the credits,\Nso feel free to do what you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.96,0:01:01.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I-I think it's bad manners not to stay\Nseated until the lights come up!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.42,0:01:06.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Ah, yes. Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.33,0:01:10.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Being able to have this kind of\Nconversation is probably really fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.00,0:01:24.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What happened to Menou?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.21,0:01:31.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Okay, time to begin one final struggle.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.71,0:01:33.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Ready...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.33,0:01:35.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Action!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.75,0:03:29.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It shouldn't be long before the\Nfog captures Pandemonium.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.13,0:03:32.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Then if we hold out until then, we win.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.88,0:03:36.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Still, that thing is a pain to deal with.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.88,0:03:41.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But it only has as many lives as the\Nnumber of people sacrificed to it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.75,0:03:47.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If we keep cutting it down, its lives will eventually run out!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.13,0:03:50.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Maa!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.00,0:03:57.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But before that, your lives might run out first, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.71,0:04:04.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If it's a matter of brute strength, I shan't lose!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.50,0:04:14.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Maa! What a powerful blow!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.71,0:04:23.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh no! The scattered limbs are heading into town!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.88,0:04:27.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I guess I walked right into that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.04,0:04:30.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Your Highness, please go! I'll deal with things here!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.25,0:04:32.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll take you up on that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.58,0:04:37.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Now it's just you! How awful!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.29,0:04:44.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It seems like connecting to the\Nearthen vein recharged your ether a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.67,0:04:45.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What a weird body you have.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.21,0:04:47.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Not as weird as yours!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.25,0:04:51.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Still, I definitely don't have ether to spare.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.71,0:04:55.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure if I can hold her off\Nuntil the fog swallows her up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.83,0:05:01.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Menou...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.46,0:05:04.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,She'll probably yell at me...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.67,0:05:07.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But even so...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.42,0:05:09.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I want to protect Menou!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.13,0:05:14.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Maa!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.50,0:05:18.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Look, everyone!\NThe nice lady's going to play with you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.29,0:05:28.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,How's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.21,0:05:32.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The same attack over and over\Nagain will bore the audience, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.46,0:05:42.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,My scripture!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.71,0:05:45.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're so strong with that thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.42,0:05:47.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I want to see you be more desperate!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.50,0:05:54.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Now what are you going to do, Miss?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.88,0:06:10.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That expression! That's right, that's what I want!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.21,0:06:12.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Try harder!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.67,0:06:16.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Don't give up!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.08,0:06:19.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Or you'll get ripped to shreds!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.33,0:06:25.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Maa?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.29,0:06:31.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.83,0:06:33.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Use it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.13,0:06:34.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Miss Priestess!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.75,0:06:37.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You owe me one!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.58,0:06:39.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Princess Ashuna!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.29,0:06:42.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,All I need is this fist of mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.71,0:06:51.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I thank you for letting me use this, Your Highness!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.21,0:07:05.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This drains more ether than I thought...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.88,0:07:07.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Maa, maa.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.00,0:07:10.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I don't think you're suited for that weapon, Miss.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.38,0:07:37.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I won't last much longer!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.75,0:07:43.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Is that it, Miss?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.21,0:07:47.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I thought you might entertain me a bit more,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.04,0:07:49.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but you were more ordinary than I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.96,0:07:53.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This ends with you dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.54,0:08:11.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Is that it, Miss?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.08,0:08:14.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I thought you might entertain me a bit more,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.96,0:08:16.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but you were more...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.79,0:08:23.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Maa, and I told her not to come. How nasty of her!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.54,0:08:24.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Menou!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.00,0:08:31.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Akari!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.08,0:08:34.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Please, Menou! Use me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.50,0:08:38.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Maa, you think you're the heroine?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.58,0:08:42.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You won't get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.67,0:08:45.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Maa.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.38,0:08:49.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I guess I don't have much time left.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.54,0:08:53.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Why did you come?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.67,0:08:54.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Because...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.63,0:08:59.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,...I don't want to let you die, Menou.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.33,0:09:05.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's why...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.63,0:09:07.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I want you to use my ether!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.88,0:09:19.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.88,0:09:22.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Your power... let me use it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.42,0:09:24.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.25,0:09:27.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Promise me you won't lose!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.00,0:09:28.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Of course not!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.25,0:09:32.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,After all, I'm a pure, just, and strong priestess!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.63,0:09:39.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Maa, what a beautiful friendship.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.67,0:09:44.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But no. What I want is a horribly dark ending!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.08,0:09:59.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That was easier than I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.46,0:10:03.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Ma-?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.08,0:10:11.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's the one that swallowed the dagger earlier!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.46,0:10:18.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Akari, here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.25,0:10:19.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.33,0:10:22.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Menou, I'll give you everything I've got!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.83,0:10:28.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Maa...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.83,0:10:56.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm happy I got to connect with Menou,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.71,0:11:00.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but maybe it was a mistake\Nfor this version of me to come.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.88,0:11:04.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Good luck explaining this one, other me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.13,0:11:15.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Akari.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.04,0:11:26.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You did great.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.92,0:11:30.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Maa...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.25,0:11:31.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Pandemonium.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.00,0:11:36.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're already out of the lives sacrificed for you.\NIsn't that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.71,0:11:41.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And you can't sacrifice your own body\Nto resurrect yourself anymore, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.96,0:11:43.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.21,0:11:47.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I separated more than half of my flesh from the real me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.96,0:11:51.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I went for giant size over invulnerability.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.58,0:11:53.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,To have fun doing this movie.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.88,0:11:56.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What are you really after?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.38,0:11:59.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Do you want revenge on the world for imprisoning you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.29,0:12:01.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Maa, how completely wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.50,0:12:05.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I was just enjoying the process. I have no objective.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.92,0:12:10.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I thought Human Errors are supposed to\Nhave lost all memories and personalities.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.21,0:12:13.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,How could you think messing up the world is "fun"?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.17,0:12:16.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's because I'm Chaos.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.00,0:12:21.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I exist in this world to kill and to bring\Nchaos in accordance with this planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.92,0:12:25.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,In the name of the Pure Concept attached to this body,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.21,0:12:27.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I interfere with all that is good.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.33,0:12:30.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So, Miss...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.08,0:12:31.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll tell you something you want to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.67,0:12:35.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The sword of certain destruction once wielded by Ivory,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.29,0:12:36.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,the Sword of Salt...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.08,0:12:40.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That has the power to destroy any Pure Concept.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.13,0:12:43.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Even that girl who governs Time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.25,0:12:47.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Are you happy? Or not so much?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.63,0:12:50.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Doesn't it make your heart uneasy?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.83,0:12:51.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.92,0:12:56.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,After all, my Chaos seeps in and poisons your very soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.17,0:13:05.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This time it's actually over, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.67,0:13:09.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Very impressive. To think you destroyed that thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.88,0:13:12.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No, it was all thanks to Your Highness's sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.83,0:13:15.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But that was merely a pinky finger.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.75,0:13:19.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,True. And there are usually two pinky fingers in all.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.67,0:13:21.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I very much doubt this is the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.75,0:13:27.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,By the way, that girl is an otherworlder, isn't she?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.38,0:13:28.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I remember seeing her.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.58,0:13:35.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Perhaps she's the reason why Pandemonium\Nmanaged to escape the fog?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.71,0:13:39.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I would very much like to talk to her...\Nabout all kinds of things.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.58,0:13:44.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But I'm rather exhausted at the moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.83,0:13:46.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll turn a blind eye, just for today.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.21,0:13:49.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Give my regards to Momo.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.63,0:14:14.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,...I'm alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.63,0:14:17.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Good morning! I'm so glad you're awake!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.96,0:14:24.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Am I... in hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.04,0:14:28.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No, no. It's the real world. How do you feel?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.04,0:14:31.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Just awful.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.29,0:14:35.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I feel like someone twisted a dagger into my head,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.63,0:14:38.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,followed by my body exploding from inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.17,0:14:41.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.79,0:14:44.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I see!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.17,0:14:48.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Then the people I used as material must\Nhave died some pretty horrible deaths.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.83,0:14:50.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,"Material"?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.21,0:14:53.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Then did you bring me back to life?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.67,0:14:54.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yup!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.46,0:14:58.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I used the dead bodies buried here\Nto reconstruct some missing parts.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.29,0:15:01.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,One of the bodies belonged to an otherworlder,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.58,0:15:04.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and that made for great magecraft material.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.83,0:15:07.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh... I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.25,0:15:11.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Why would she help me...?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.17,0:15:17.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Manon, you actually have an older sister, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.75,0:15:22.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,A bright, active girl who's full of energy...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.00,0:15:26.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,She loved singing and dancing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.21,0:15:31.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But more than anything, she loved movies.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.92,0:15:41.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Even when the memories fade\Nand your personality is gone,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.13,0:15:43.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,perhaps something remains intact.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.79,0:15:45.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What's this about?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.71,0:15:48.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, just something that ended ages ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.67,0:15:52.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,First a thousand, then ten years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.13,0:16:00.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hey, I'm thinking of doing a movie on a larger scale next!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.13,0:16:03.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You'll help me, won't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.63,0:16:05.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.21,0:16:09.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Let's bring even more chaos into this world...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.38,0:16:12.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,...you and me, together.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.58,0:16:21.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm impressed, Momo.\NPastor Sicilia was amazed how quickly you recovered.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.25,0:16:25.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's all thanks to you worrying about me, Menou.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.08,0:16:29.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Your love is the best medicine I could ever get!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.50,0:16:32.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Right, right. I do hope that's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.46,0:16:40.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Momo?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.50,0:16:44.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Um, Menou. I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.75,0:16:48.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You had a horrible time all because I messed up...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.79,0:16:51.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm the one to blame.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.71,0:16:56.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I relied on you too much when I didn't\Nhave enough information on the enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.54,0:16:58.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's not true! I-!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.88,0:17:00.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Don't get too excited.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.13,0:17:03.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're still recovering.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.42,0:17:05.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,R-right...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.75,0:17:13.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So was it the Sword of Salt...\Nthat the Human Error suggested?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.96,0:17:14.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.92,0:17:17.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Apparently it can destroy any Pure Concept.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.83,0:17:19.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Do you think that's reliable?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.63,0:17:21.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.58,0:17:26.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But it didn't sound like a lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.25,0:17:30.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Isn't the Sword of Salt near the Sanctuary,\Nin the far west?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.00,0:17:32.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,On the continent of salt.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.71,0:17:36.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I went there once with the Master, a long time ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.71,0:17:42.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm going to go there again.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.79,0:17:45.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll use the Sword of Salt to kill Akari.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.33,0:17:50.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So that she doesn't become an\Natrocity the way Pandemonium did...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.29,0:17:57.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Momo, will you come along like you've been doing,\Nwithout revealing yourself to Akari?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.04,0:17:59.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.04,0:18:01.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Of course I can do that...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.46,0:18:05.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.88,0:18:09.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Not only for tending to Momo,\Nbut for the compensation as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.58,0:18:10.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.67,0:18:14.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I hate to think how much more damage\Nthere might have been without you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.46,0:18:19.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Though it's still more than I would prefer to handle.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.58,0:18:24.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you'll bring peace back to\Nthe city in no time, Pastor Sicilia.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.08,0:18:28.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Are you trying to make up for what your Master said?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.42,0:18:30.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Not at all. I truly mean it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.63,0:18:35.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well then, if you'll excuse me...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.58,0:18:37.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Ms. Menou.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.21,0:18:42.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,One last thing. This may be unnecessary...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.21,0:18:46.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But you're different from Flare.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.17,0:18:53.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You should follow your own path,\Nno matter what kind of path it may be.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.75,0:19:03.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If, hypothetically,\NI could guarantee that Akari would never kill anyone,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.29,0:19:08.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,harm anything,\Nor let her Pure Concept go out of control...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.79,0:19:10.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What would I do then?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.38,0:19:17.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm back.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.54,0:19:19.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Menou!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.88,0:19:23.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Akari?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.46,0:19:26.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.88,0:19:30.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Because... I woke up and you were gone,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.13,0:19:32.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and I thought you might have left me behind...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.38,0:19:36.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Of course not!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.08,0:19:39.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I just went to the church to talk with Pastor Sicilia.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.00,0:19:48.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Akari, are you asleep?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.00,0:19:50.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.96,0:19:53.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I just want to confirm something.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.33,0:19:56.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You really don't remember anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.17,0:20:01.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,From halfway through the evening ball to\Nwhen you woke up after the battle?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.63,0:20:03.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Th-that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.04,0:20:05.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I really have no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.88,0:20:08.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.17,0:20:13.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Both when I rescued her and when\Nshe came during the battle,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.42,0:20:16.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Akari was clearly conscious.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.96,0:20:20.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But it doesn't look like she's lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.75,0:20:24.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I don't think Akari's the type who's\Ngood at hiding things, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.83,0:20:25.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Menou.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.67,0:20:31.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I don't remember, but I worried you, didn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.63,0:20:35.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I won't ever do that again. I'm really sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.00,0:20:39.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So please, don't hate me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.46,0:20:46.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're so silly.\NI wouldn't hate you for something like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.96,0:20:49.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,After all, you're my-
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.00,0:20:54.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,"You're my" what?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.75,0:20:57.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hey, what were you going to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.83,0:20:58.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hey! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.25,0:21:01.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This is your one chance to say it! Right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.75,0:21:05.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Come on! Come on! Come on!\NCome on! Come on! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.46,0:21:08.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Uh... my source of stress on the journey...?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.21,0:21:12.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,MENOU!!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.71,0:21:16.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You can't, Menou.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.50,0:21:18.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The Menou I love,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.71,0:21:22.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,the one who's a valiant Executioner,\Ncan't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.17,0:21:28.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If you act for her sake,\NI just know those feelings will eat away at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.67,0:21:30.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's why...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.17,0:21:36.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll do it instead... and kill her myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.00,0:21:48.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Once again, we're setting off for the Sanctuary,\Nhuh Menou?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.42,0:21:51.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's right. You'd better be ready for this, Akari.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.13,0:21:53.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's not going to be an easy journey.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.25,0:21:55.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Aye-aye, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.54,0:21:58.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll be fine as long as we're together, Menou!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.04,0:22:01.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's right, as long as we're together.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.42,0:22:04.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If, hypothetically,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.71,0:22:10.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I could guarantee that Akari would never let her\NPure Concept go out of control, I would...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.21,0:22:15.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No, that's not for me to think about.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.67,0:22:18.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Before Akari loses all of her memories or sense of self,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.46,0:22:19.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I swear I'll kill her.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.29,0:22:25.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,After all, I'm a pure, just, and strong villain!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.71,0:22:28.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hey, let's take the first step together again!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.08,0:22:31.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, all right. Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.17,0:22:34.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Okay, here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.75,0:22:36.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Ready, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.50,0:22:48.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Menou, no matter what stands in your way,\Nmake sure you kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.38,0:22:49.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And make sure you survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.88,0:22:54.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll do anything to ensure that happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.71,0:23:21.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So not only Chaos,\Nbut a portion of Vessel has also escaped...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.17,0:23:27.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This is the first time even a fragment has\Nemerged since the Starhusk hatched.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.75,0:23:31.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It was worth the insufferable number\Nof repetitions we've gone through.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.13,0:23:35.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Now then, time to get going...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.79,0:23:39.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,...to kill my apprentice for the zillionth time.
